                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "27a72e2f-ab7b-38b9-a3db-e217f439150c",
                        "entry_id": "e4578d12-1cf3-3e92-b533-eabed24e8d27",
                        "glosses": [
                            "пребывание членом какой-либо организации"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c011f7d-cf3d-4167-94ab-04747b9f2920",
                                "sense_id": "27a72e2f-ab7b-38b9-a3db-e217f439150c",
                                "text": "Членство в товариществе собственников жилья возникает у собственника помещения в многоквартирном доме на основании заявления о вступлении в товарищество собственников жилья."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c9fc8e18-8b31-4044-978a-c39bd029470d",
                        "source_entry_id": "e4578d12-1cf3-3e92-b533-eabed24e8d27",
                        "source_sense_id": "27a72e2f-ab7b-38b9-a3db-e217f439150c",
                        "target_lang_word": "membership",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "membership",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fbd83d6d-cf2f-32f9-9441-a3774923f6a1",
                                        "entry_id": "447e796b-e19b-38e2-ba53-67954fbd6b50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being a member of a group or organization."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76c2b50e-50b2-49fc-b815-d9c0e81e95ba",
                                                "sense_id": "fbd83d6d-cf2f-32f9-9441-a3774923f6a1",
                                                "text": "The terms of membership agreement were vague."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "126aed33-abf8-4110-9950-a26222fa3c70",
                                                "sense_id": "fbd83d6d-cf2f-32f9-9441-a3774923f6a1",
                                                "text": "He has memberships in clubs in three cities."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd1376e7-8260-424e-ac21-c33ca6185546",
                                                "sense_id": "fbd83d6d-cf2f-32f9-9441-a3774923f6a1",
                                                "text": "But when Krystal McConnell and Ashley Flynn were named deep in the heart of the '80s the thing was cuteness, feminine delicacy raised to an aesthetic paradigm. --- And everyone named according to a particular version of the pedigree fantasy. Ashley : transplanted Southern privilege, a destiny lying in sorority mixers and a marriage of health club memberships, state-of-the-art appliances and night courses in nouvelle cuisine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "480b2a31-7c7e-4b3b-a28c-81f588b2df4a",
                                                "sense_id": "fbd83d6d-cf2f-32f9-9441-a3774923f6a1",
                                                "text": "Hence there resulted a division of the membership of the brotherhood into two classes, the practical and theoretic, or, as they are more commonly called, the operative and speculative, or “domatic” and “geomatic.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df54abff-25a1-3937-8e7f-1dd924ba4816",
                                        "entry_id": "447e796b-e19b-38e2-ba53-67954fbd6b50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The body of members of an organization."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b582de1d-d930-4f49-a0bd-e1313d6c94cf",
                                                "sense_id": "df54abff-25a1-3937-8e7f-1dd924ba4816",
                                                "text": "The memberships of the state chapters elect delegates to the national convention."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8007e59-e30b-3bad-b817-2098bd2b5a58",
                                        "entry_id": "447e796b-e19b-38e2-ba53-67954fbd6b50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fact of being a member of a set."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "membership",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f457edf0-f0f2-3d9c-9c85-52c2c0b6f12e",
                                        "entry_id": "c23aaf58-e704-3a57-813d-170cd653a834",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To classify (someone) as belonging to a certain group or community."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98470988-6e3c-4504-bc7c-96360b700954",
                                                "sense_id": "f457edf0-f0f2-3d9c-9c85-52c2c0b6f12e",
                                                "text": "Whatever the topic of the conversation the speaker must ‘membership’ his listener, put him into one of two or more mutually exclusive boxes. Each time a topic changes the listener must be re-membershipped, and during a conversation the same person may be membershipped as a doctor, a rugby player, a liberal, a gardener, a bridge player."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb0dff27-287f-4ec8-8e31-882b848b4f76",
                        "source_entry_id": "e4578d12-1cf3-3e92-b533-eabed24e8d27",
                        "source_sense_id": "27a72e2f-ab7b-38b9-a3db-e217f439150c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Mitgliedschaft",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mitgliedschaft",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dbb6afed-f33c-3636-9a64-067abc04518f",
                                        "entry_id": "2f9e5e1b-bd56-3df2-966d-88b63a919a99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zustand, in dem jemand Mitglied von etwas ist"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5b728c2-3a68-452c-acbc-ae492f3295a8",
                                                "sense_id": "dbb6afed-f33c-3636-9a64-067abc04518f",
                                                "text": "Ich möchte meine Mitgliedschaft im Schützenverein kündigen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36587ae7-ca7a-4180-9658-3777c8b70155",
                                                "sense_id": "dbb6afed-f33c-3636-9a64-067abc04518f",
                                                "text": "„Die Mitgliedschaft dauert sechs Jahre, eine Wiederberufung ist jedoch möglich.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "313eb90b-3f08-44d6-bc66-ce4cb171d74a",
                                                "sense_id": "dbb6afed-f33c-3636-9a64-067abc04518f",
                                                "text": "„Auf dem NATO-Gipfel in Bukarest wurde der Ukraine und Georgien eine Mitgliedschaft [Anmerkung: in der NATO] zwar in Aussicht gestellt, doch ohne Datum.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "480db8ed-0700-4f62-bc86-52fb8ffa7012",
                        "source_entry_id": "e4578d12-1cf3-3e92-b533-eabed24e8d27",
                        "source_sense_id": "27a72e2f-ab7b-38b9-a3db-e217f439150c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Teilhaberschaft",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7cb8ca1d-6283-474f-8ddf-d458193655aa",
                        "source_entry_id": "e4578d12-1cf3-3e92-b533-eabed24e8d27",
                        "source_sense_id": "27a72e2f-ab7b-38b9-a3db-e217f439150c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zugehörigkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zugehörigkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ee2c899-c222-3201-8b2c-3b52ad99d798",
                                        "entry_id": "6f5c38ca-2279-30d4-a539-3b7d31629b2b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eigenschaft, zu etwas dazuzugehören, Mitglied von etwas zu sein"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5604c469-d3c0-42a8-8019-54e936437025",
                                                "sense_id": "7ee2c899-c222-3201-8b2c-3b52ad99d798",
                                                "text": "„Kriminalität hat keine Religion oder ethnische Zugehörigkeit, sie ist weder türkisch noch deutsch.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0acdad72-a8a6-4f34-8290-21e1d6e014b3",
                                                "sense_id": "7ee2c899-c222-3201-8b2c-3b52ad99d798",
                                                "text": "„Wahlbestechungen wurden ein gängiges Mittel der Politik, und gegen Ende des 2. Jahrhunderts v.Chr. setzte eine erfolgreiche politische Laufbahn nicht mehr ausschließlich die Zugehörigkeit zur Nobilität und persönliche Leistung voraus, sondern vor allem große Geldmittel.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b604f24-fafd-49f6-a95a-2469d81cd067",
                                                "sense_id": "7ee2c899-c222-3201-8b2c-3b52ad99d798",
                                                "text": "„Und nun werden sie von schwarzen Politikern übernommen, um so eine Hausmacht auf die Zugehörigkeit zu ihrem Volk zu gründen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6eb4c2e-5f54-4f6c-a0b0-3959ee1975d0",
                                                "sense_id": "7ee2c899-c222-3201-8b2c-3b52ad99d798",
                                                "text": "„Dank seiner ethnischen Zugehörigkeit bekam er einen Posten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06d7c7de-2d33-47f5-9005-a18a140a0405",
                                                "sense_id": "7ee2c899-c222-3201-8b2c-3b52ad99d798",
                                                "text": "„Das zeigt sich ebenso am eigenartigen Verhältnis von Juden und Deutschen wie an der grundsätzlichen Art und Weise, in der hierzulande über Zugehörigkeit diskutiert wird.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
